{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10609016","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10609016","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1060901601:1":{"text":"それはエスペリアにいる大勢のメイジが、力を合わせて時を凝縮して生み出した時の種から育った、不思議なものだよ！","source_cn":"那是伊索米亚众多魔法师一同凝结时光，时光之种生长而成的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BD3E6A3DF57CE81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1060901602:1":{"text":"植物？それとも純粋な魔力の凝縮体？諸説あるのさ！魔力でできた文字が木のてっぺんから浮かび上がったところを見た人もいるんだよ。","source_cn":"是植物？还是纯粹魔力汇聚而成的？众说纷纭！还有人见过从...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9FDAC86F552B0B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1060901603:1":{"text":"本当に不思議な光景だなぁ……歌にして残さないと！","source_cn":"真是奇景啊，我应该为它留下一首歌谣！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09B5C74C9B97168E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:吟游诗人里奇":{"text":"吟遊詩人のリッチ","source":"吟游诗人里奇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}